{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9ef95f8566749dd4","type":"text","text":"[[Dolor Matris]]\n#DolorMatris","x":-800,"y":-700,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a617fb7954c22731","type":"text","text":"At the top of the staircase is a short hallway shattered and destroyed with floating rock as the only way beyond it, opening to the entire area in the sky. \n\nOn the otherside there is a split that goes left and right.","x":-760,"y":-440,"width":522,"height":191},
		{"id":"42c31c94fc74377e","type":"text","text":"Left: Ravinas room.\n\n\nkept in stasis is a pristine white marble room with no dust in it a white bed with white sheets and a mosquito net hanging above it. \n\nA mirror on the far side of the room and a painting of a Elven woman with long black hair kissing a red headed girl on the forhead\n\n","x":-1060,"y":-140,"width":425,"height":260},
		{"id":"38e57841478204b6","type":"text","text":"Behind the painting:\n\n500 plat and","x":-1065,"y":320,"width":436,"height":279},
		{"id":"2ed775f1d6ef8e70","type":"file","file":"Domains of Dread/images/Pasted image 20260926112817.png","x":-1900,"y":34,"width":340,"height":851},
		{"id":"2f82dfb91de2f91b","type":"link","url":"https://roll20.net/compendium/dnd5e/Deck%20of%20Many%20Things#content","x":-2500,"y":917,"width":940,"height":903},
		{"id":"9fdceec2df9fed6d","type":"file","file":"Domains of Dread/images/Pasted image 20260926112831.png","x":-1320,"y":885,"width":420,"height":873},
		{"id":"410b02a4eb2e0282","type":"text","text":"Right Maelles room.\n\nA room where it looks like decay could not reach, with a balcony that is directly inline with the face of the Matron herself.\n\nMarble floors with a queen sized bed that is pink a wardrobe with old clothes a mirror. \n\nAt the side of the bed a desk with nothing on it. \n\nA painting of a red headed girl laughing at a black haired boy who fell.\n\n","x":-77,"y":-133,"width":537,"height":373},
		{"id":"2b0a179fc3cce25f","type":"text","text":"Within the desk is the key to Divinas book","x":-270,"y":574,"width":410,"height":126}
	],
